    "updated_at": "2016-02-05T19:58:48Z",
    "body": "So I'm suspecting that [this test](https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/blob/master/html/infrastructure/common-dom-interfaces/collections/radionodelist.html#L69) is perhaps wrong? The element with an ID of \"r1\" is set with a value [here](https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/blob/master/html/infrastructure/common-dom-interfaces/collections/radionodelist.html#L36) in an earlier test, and then an attempt to reset it was done by using `removeAttribute` on the \"r1\" element.\n",
